<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Feature Importance</title>
    <style>
        h3 { ${REGULAR_LARGE_FONT_STYLE} }
        body { ${REGULAR_FONT_STYLE} }
        code { ${MONOSPACE_FONT_STYLE} }
        h3 code { font-size: inherit; }
        p { margin-top: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h3>Feature Importance</h3>
    <p>How much each column helps predict the target value, shown as a percentage from 0% (no relationship) to 100% (fully explains it). This is about your <em>data</em>, not the model you trained - the same for any algorithm.</p>
    <p>SALARY at 80% and OFFICE_COLOR at 2%? Salary is one of the strongest predictors here; office color barely matters.</p>
    <p>Calculated with <code>DBMS_PREDICTIVE_ANALYTICS.EXPLAIN</code> .</p>
</body>
</html>
